--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- natural periods and mode shapes of the Gulf of Mexico 80 m lazy-wave cable
-- Modal analysis (nModes) of the finite-EI lazy-wave power cable of lozon_gomex80_power_cable.dat
-- (Lozon et al., 2025) on its production mesh (1024 elements):
-- the 10 lowest natural frequencies and mode shapes about the static equilibrium, ends held,
-- with the Morison added mass and the linearised seabed contact stiffness, written to
-- <root>.modes.out. The finite-EI modal analysis needs a dynamic deck, so one 0.05 s step follows.
